{"3891060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Into the Dataswarm", "steam_appid": 3891060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Into the Dataswarm</strong> is a 2.5D turn-based puzzle game, where you play as Anni the cyber elf, whose goal is to rid the Corrupters from cyberspace. Hack and steal access keys from the Corrupters in order to unlock the escape point and dive deeper into the core of cyberspace. But watch out! Stealing their keys will make them frenzy and take drastic measures to stop you! Careful planning and movement is imperative in order to solve each of our hand-crafted levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891060/extras/f3a26c5061474076c12dd78caadbba45.poster.avif?t=1760329544\" width=480 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891060/extras/f3a26c5061474076c12dd78caadbba45.webm?t=1760329544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891060/extras/f3a26c5061474076c12dd78caadbba45.mp4?t=1760329544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a fun and short story told over <strong>20 different levels</strong> and across <strong>2+ worlds</strong> that feature obstacles that add layers of complexity to your escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay and discover <strong>hidden achievements</strong> across several levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>chaotically</strong> or <strong>strategically</strong>! Figure out different ways to escape each level and <strong>optimize</strong> your clears!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understand the Corrupters' behaviors and <strong>exploit</strong> them to solve challenging and 