s <strong>2+ worlds</strong> that feature obstacles that add layers of complexity to your escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay and discover <strong>hidden achievements</strong> across several levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>chaotically</strong> or <strong>strategically</strong>! Figure out different ways to escape each level and <strong>optimize</strong> your clears!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understand the Corrupters' behaviors and <strong>exploit</strong> them to solve challenging and dangerous levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891060/extras/ef9132d482418e1122875e0843274fd7.poster.avif?t=1760329544\" width=480 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891060/extras/ef9132d482418e1122875e0843274fd7.webm?t=1760329544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891060/extras/ef9132d482418e1122875e0843274fd7.mp4?t=1760329544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Into the Dataswarm is a turn-based puzzle game inspired by Metal Gear Solid and Megaman, featuring simple, yet intricate levels to solve. Steal access keys from the Corrupters by hacking them, unlock the exit and avoid their attempts to hinder you, as you investigate a way to stop their invasion.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891060/02e8b5ac6bedcca01565ce91156030e1ab11467d/header.jpg?t=1760329544", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891060/a355faf079a0661c957f0180bb70cba1ced6825b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760329544", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/38